    <textTemplates>
        <name>remainder1Body</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Dear {!Get_Opp_Id.EYI_Opportunity_Name__c},
This email serves as a follow-up regarding the stamp duty payment, referencing our previous communication
sent on {!today} , in which we outlined the stamp duty amount due for the registration process. Our records indicate that the deadline for payment has now passed, and as of today, we have not yet received the required payment.
As emphasized earlier, timely payment of the stamp duty is crucial for the smooth progression of the registration process. Any delay in completing this payment may result in an unfortunate delay in the registration or could potentially impact the progression of your {!Get_Opp_Id.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name} as planned.
We kindly request that you settle the payment at your earliest convenience. For your reference, the stamp
duty amount due is {!Get_Opp_Id.EYI_SD_Balance_Amount__c}. Please ensure that the payment is made promptly to avoid any further complications. If you require assistance with payment instructions or clarification, please do not hesitate to reach out to us. Failure to complete the payment may result in a delay of the registration process, so we encourage you to act swiftly in order to proceed smoothly. Should you have any questions or need further assistance, please feel free to contact us at {!Get_Opp_Id.EYI_Relationship_Manager__r.MobilePhone}. We are here to help facilitate the process and ensure a smooth resolution.

Thank you for your immediate attention to this matter.
Best regards,
{!Get_Opp_Id.EYI_Relationship_Manager__r.Name}
Relationship Manager
Panchshil Realty</text>
    </textTemplates>
